[31m-Vercel runs the `/api/maintenance/creator-photos` cron once daily. Set `CRON_SECRET` to a random secret with at least 32 characters in the deployment settings. The endpoint removes only creator photos older than 24 hours that have no corresponding creator-registration row, covering storage objects left behind by an interrupted upload/database write. When moving to Cloudflare, port this cleanup to a scheduled Worker or another trusted scheduler; do not expose the endpoint without the bearer secret.[m
